# Canonical author identities for this repository.
#
# Git and GitHub honour .mailmap to coalesce commits authored under
# alternate names/emails into a single canonical contributor. We use it to
# fold automated dependency-bump commits (Dependabot) into the maintainer so
# the bot does not appear as a separate contributor — no history rewrite,
# no force-push.
#
# Format: Canonical Name <canonical-email> <commit-email-to-remap>

